Package: phenologytools
Type: Package
Title: Phenology Analysis Utilities for eBird-Based Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "John", family = "Schnase", 
           email = "jschnase@mac.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Minimal R package wrapping utilities for extracting, summarizing, 
    and visualizing breeding-season phenology from eBird data. Functions are
    documented with roxygen2 and intended for research workflows.
